<title>GERMANY: G7 ministers, central bankers to meet in Berlin Feb. 8.</title>
<headline>G7 ministers, central bankers to meet in Berlin Feb. 8.</headline>
<dateline>BONN, Germany</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance ministers and central bank chiefs from the Group of Seven industrial nations will meet in Berlin on Feb. 8 to discuss wide-ranging economic issues, a German Finance Ministry spokesman said Friday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the gathering will be similar to a G7 meeting held in Paris last year.</p>
</text>
